@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam BackgroundColor #ffffff
title Logical view · service interfaces and owned data
top to bottom direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 20
skinparam LegendFontSize 19
skinparam titleFontSize 23
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 30
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
component "frontend/ + publisher/" as clients <<clients>> $CLIENT
component "HttpApi\nGatewayAuthorizer" as gateway <<HTTP API>> $INFRA
component "MediaAuthorizer\nHS256 + current User" as auth $MEDIA
component "media/\n----\nMediaApi\nMediaRepair\nMediaResults" as media <<composite service>> $MEDIA
component "processing/\n----\nProcessingApi\nCommands / repair\nEncoders / launcher" as processing <<composite service>> $PROC
database "media_db" as md $MEDIA
database "processing_db" as pd $PROC
component "SourceBucket\nOutputBucket" as s3 <<S3>> $INFRA
interface "/api/media/*" as media_http
interface "/api/processing/*" as processing_http
' scripts/aws/v1/definitions.py (HttpApi, GatewayAuthorizer, integrations)
clients .down.> gateway : HTTPS
gateway .right.> auth : REQUEST
gateway ..> media_http : requires
gateway ..> processing_http : requires
media_http -- media
processing_http -- processing
' delivery/sqs.py queue lanes
media .right.> processing : <<flow>>\ncommands queue\nsubmit / retry / cancel
processing .left.> media : <<flow>>\nresults queue
auth ..> md : User lookup
media ..> md : owned SQL
processing ..> pd : owned SQL
md -[hidden]right-> s3
s3 -[hidden]right-> pd
legend bottom
 Blue Media · amber Processing · green clients · slate infrastructure.
 Circle + line = provided HTTP interface; dashed arrow = dependency.
 <<flow>> = asynchronous message through SQS, not peer HTTP.
 Media writes sources and reads outputs;
 Processing reads sources and writes outputs.
endlegend
@enduml
